/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (VVBHSS celebrated the Kids Fest - "Dhwani  2025 " on 16/01/2025, Thursday with great enthusiasm and fervor. Kumari Shreya Dileep welcomed the gathering.Adv.Sundaram Govind \(Chairman of Geetha Bhavan Trust \)  presided the session.Sri.Gopi .R. \(Principal\) delivered the keynote address.The  occasion was graced by Honorable MLA, Sri Anwar Sadath , who inaugurated the event and addressed the gathering.Sri. AV.Prasad \( Manager\) , Sri. Sreekanth .N \(PTA Vice President\) , Smt.Parvathi T.G \( Vice Principal\), Smt.Uma Rajendran \( Academic coordinator\), Smt.Sreerekha Rajesh \(President, Mothers forum\) were felicitated the event. The session concluded with Vote of Thanks proposed by Master  Reghunand Anoop. The  cultural programme was a vibrant display of music ,dance and drama. Students from KG, Std I and Std II participated in the program ,showcasing their  talents and achievements.  The event was a grand success.)
